actions.supported_help = I rekhoda ndaela dza zwo nangiwaho dzo khunyeledzwaho, dziḽeyara ntswa/dzo kopiwaho/dzo shandukiselwaho kha dzipixel/dzo ṱanganyiswaho, u ḓadza nga muvhala wa phanḓa/murahu, Gaussian/Box/Motion Blur, Sharpen, Unsharp Mask, Median, na nzudzanyo.
actions.unsupported_help = Mitalo ya bulatsho, u nanga ḽeyara nga tshanḓa, tshanduko dza tshivhumbeo, u tshimbila kha ḓivhazwakale, dzi-fiḽithara dza nnḓa kana dzi ḓitikaho nga zwishumiswa, dzi-fiḽithara dza u sokou nanga, thulwi dza dzi-fiḽithara na ndaela dza faela/app a zwi rekhodiwi. U dzudzanya tshanele ya mvelo na nzudzanyo dzi tshinyadzaho dza CMYK/Lab a zwi tikedzwi.
actions.replay_help = Maga a shumiswa kha ḽeyara i shumaho na zwo nangiwaho zwino. Undo nthihi i humisela murahu nyito yoṱhe. Ḽiga ḽi kundelwaho ḽi humisela murahu nyito yoṱhe. Zwilangi zwa nomboro zwi dzudzanya nyito ine ya khou shumiwa; Vhulunga nyito zwi vhulunga tshanduko.
actions.play_document = Tambisa hafhu kha ḽiṅwalo ḽi shumaho
actions.played = Nyito yo tambiswa hafhu: {name}
actions.batch_help = U tambisa hafhu kha gaḽari zwi thoma kha tshanduko iṅwe na iṅwe yo vhulungwaho arali i hone, arali i si hone zwi thoma kha tshifanyiso tsha mathomo, na ḽeyara yatsho i shumaho yo vhulungwaho kana ḽeyara ya dzipixel ya nṱhesa. Mvelelo ndi khophi ntswa dza PSD kha foḽuda ye na nanga. Zwifanyiso zwa mathomo na tshanduko dzo vhulungwaho a zwi kwamiwi.
